# YouTube Data API v3 credentials
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/ and create (or select) a project.
# 2. Enable the "YouTube Data API v3" for the project.
# 3. Create an API key under APIs & Services → Credentials.
# 4. In production, restrict the key to your site's HTTP referrer so it cannot
#    be abused if extracted from browser DevTools.

VITE_YT_API_KEY=your_youtube_data_api_v3_key_here
